# Files that are COPYied into Linux containers must keep LF line endings regardless of the platform
# the repo is checked out on (core.autocrlf=true on Windows would otherwise rewrite them to CRLF,
# which breaks a mosquitto.conf parsed on Linux). Every mock's server.js is COPYied the same way,
# so the pattern covers the loops to come, not just the one that first hit it.
src/mqtt/mosquitto.conf text eol=lf
src/*-mock/server.js text eol=lf
